    SHDL --> SSVC
    SSVC --> SSTORE & CSVC & OINS
    SSVC --> GH

    CSVC --> CSTORE & FENQ
    WORK --> CSVC & GH

    FW --> SSVC & OINS
    FW --> PG

    SSTORE & CSTORE & FENQ & OINS --> PG
    RELAY --> PG
    RELAY --> NC & NR

    NC & NR --> CONS --> SMAIL
    SMAIL --> SMTP
    CONS -->|retries exhausted or poison| ND
    ND --> DLQC

    API  -.->|imports| CONTRACT
    NSVC -.->|imports| CONTRACT
